{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/22257a6c15761a41be75acf30b43d8b5.avif?t=1771842007\" width=616 height=322 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T BLINK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Versus in the Dark</i>  is a high-speed precision platform fighter where everyone\u2019s invisible! Sneak into the night while keeping eyes on your opponents, lest they strike from the shadows to backstab you.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/11b618404dff0540df79bc37c7b32abd.poster.avif?t=1771842007\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/11b618404dff0540df79bc37c7b32abd.webm?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/11b618404dff0540df79bc37c7b32abd.mp4?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEE, SLASH &amp; DISAPPEAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide  and use the environment to trap your opponents. Watch out : sky-ripping thunderstorms, a flickering light, a snowfall or even a simple door opening could reveal your position to other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/1c446522e7615df59fab1a7b303432d5.poster.avif?t=1771842007\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/1c446522e7615df59fab1a7b303432d5.webm?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/1c446522e7615df59fab1a7b303432d5.mp4?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMPLE &amp; DEEP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three buttons, no combos, no life bar\u2014just one-hit kills! Simple and easy to play, enjoyable for everyone in a few seconds. Master the art of invisibility in strategic and nervous battles mixing platforming, stealth, swordplay with lightsaber katanas and shurikens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/e9324332b0935444b25d21f08e1eb62f.poster.avif?t=1771842007\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/e9324332b0935444b25d21f08e1eb62f.webm?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/e9324332b0935444b25d21f08e1eb62f.mp4?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE + COUCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, free-for-all deathmatch and team play. Play on the couch with your friends or versus the world ! Feel the thrill of being the last man standing.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/a17c2c61640e79416378b32d20a534d2.poster.avif?t=1771842007\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/a17c2c61640e79416378b32d20a534d2.webm?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/extras/a17c2c61640e79416378b32d20a534d2.mp4?t=1771842007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd77Play as an\u00a0<strong>INVISIBLE NINJA</strong> and trap you opponents in a merciless, fast-paced platform fighter game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f<strong>EASY TO PICK UP, HARD TO MASTER</strong>. Everyone can play and enjoy,\u00a0but you\u2019ll need cunning and precision to triumph ! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8A stylish <strong>PIXEL ART STYLE</strong> mixing feudal Japanese and street culture, where torii gates are illuminated by neon lights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7a Customize your ninja with tons of <strong>MASKS &amp; HATS</strong> then battle across one of the 50 maps showcasing unique ways to play and stay invisible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10Last man standing, Capture the lantern, Team play... Up to 5 customizable game modes to play<strong> ONLINE AND LOCALLY</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f<strong>LIGHTSABER KATANAS</strong> Because regular ones are \u2026. boring?  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller is required for local multiplayer. We support a variety of controllers including <strong>Xbox, PlayStation, Switch</strong> and many more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3064240?t=1771842007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3064240?t=1771842007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771842007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3064240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771842007","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"descripti